<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian PM to hold Friday news conference.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian PM to hold Friday news conference.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Prime Minister John Howard will hold an &quot;end of year press conference&quot; on Friday at 10.30 a.m. (2330 GMT), his office said on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61- 29373-1800</p>
